# AI coding assistants. BMAD reinstalls and updates regenerate all of these,
# so they are reproducible on any machine and must never be committed.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE ADDING A PATH HERE. Gitignore is only consulted for
# UNTRACKED files. If a path is already committed the rule does nothing until
# you run `git rm -r --cached <path>`, which drops it from the index and leaves
# it on disk. That is exactly why `.claude` sat in this file from 2026-08-12
# with no effect: its 876 files had been committed on 2026-08-04.
AGENTS.md
# The root guide is hand-written repository policy and stays tracked.
!/AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.agents/
.agent/
.claude/
.cursor/
.codex/
.antigravity/
.gemini/

# Raw per-story run evidence (logs, build outputs, worker copies). Summaries live in
# _bmad-output/implementation-artifacts.
_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-*/**
# Directories stay visible so the tracked holdout reviews below can be re-included.
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-*/**/
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-8/reviews/cc68-tea-text-holdout-v4.md
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-8/reviews/cc68-tea-text-holdout-v5.md
# Story 6.9 commits its iPad anchor proof so the PR evidence check can verify it.
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-9/README.md
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-9/ipad-anchor-proof.json
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-9/ipad-anchor-*.png
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-9/android-status-bar-*.png
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-9/composer-status-*.png
!_bmad-output/test-artifacts/story-6-9/web-stale-*.png
